@startuml

title Database per Service: a service reaches another's data only through its operations

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
component "ores.ore" as ore
component "ores.refdata" as rd
component "ores.analytics" as an
database "refdata tables" as rdt
database "analytics tables" as ant
ore --> rd : refdata.v1.*.get (token)
ore --> an : analytics.v1.*.get (token)
rd --> rdt : owns
an --> ant : owns
ore ..> rdt : never
note right of rdt : one physical PostgreSQL may hold\nboth; ownership is still per service
@enduml
